# Request: which bottle/glass (by TF frame id / known scene object name)
# and how much to pour. Phase 1 has exactly one bottle and one glass at
# fixed, known poses -- bottle_id/glass_id exist now so the interface
# doesn't need to change when perception and multiple bottles are added.
string bottle_id
string glass_id
float32 pour_amount_ml
---
# Result
bool success
string message
float32 estimated_poured_ml
---
# Feedback: coarse state machine progress, for later UI/voice layers to
# narrate ("picking up the bottle", "pouring now", ...) without polling.
string state
float32 progress
